<!--
    UI texts. This file is the default language (English); translations live in values-es, values-fr, values-de, values-it and
    values-pt (every key must exist in all of them, except the ones marked translatable="false").
    Conventions:
      - Titles, labels, buttons and terminal status codes: CAPITAL LETTERS. In the translations, no accents or special letters in
        capitals (the VGA font lacks several accented capitals; lowercase has them all).
      - Terminal codes with underscores (> LOADING_SHADER, PROFILE_UPDATED...) are the look of the app: translatable="false".
      - Help texts, descriptions, warnings and errors: normal sentences.
      - No emojis: the CRT font doesn't have them.
    Console names in the resolution profiles (Game Boy, NES...) are proper names and stay in the code.
-->
