    <string name="guide_index_title">> GUIDE</string>
    <string name="guide_welcome_title">> WELCOME</string>
    <string name="guide_welcome_body">ShaderVulkan draws a retro shader (CRT, scanlines...) over any app.\n\n1. Two modes. CAPTURE processes the real image; GLASS draws a layer with no capture, works in protected apps and is the lightest.\n\n2. Two permissions. Accessibility, to draw on top and let your touches through; and, in Capture, your OK to share the screen. Nothing leaves your phone.\n\n3. The floating dot opens the menu. The rest is in the guide, in SETTINGS.</string>
